{"task_id": "Mbpp/75", "solution": "def find_tuples(list_of_tuples, k):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds tuples from a list where all elements are divisible by k.\n    Assumes valid input: list_of_tuples is an iterable of tuples of integers, k is a non-zero integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for t in list_of_tuples:\n        if all(element % k == 0 for element in t):\n            result.append(t)\n    return result"}
