{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "def list_split(lst: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"Splits a list into n sublists, distributing elements by index modulo n.\n    Each sublist contains every nth element from the original list, starting at successive offsets.\"\"\"\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for idx, item in enumerate(lst):\n        result[idx % n].append(item)\n    return result"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/264", "solution": "def dog_age(years: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates a dog's age in dog years using the 10.5/10.5/4 algorithm.\n\n    The first two human years are 10.5 dog years each, and subsequent years are 4 dog years each.\n    \"\"\"\n    if years <= 0:\n        return 0\n    if years == 1:\n        return int(round(10.5))\n    if years == 2:\n        return int(round(10.5 + 10.5))\n    return int(round(10.5 + 10.5 + (years - 2) * 4))"}
