{"task_id": "Mbpp/269", "solution": "def ascii_value(char: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the ASCII value of a single character.\n\n    Parameters:\n    - char: a single-character string\n\n    Returns:\n    - int: ASCII code of the character\n\n    Raises:\n    - TypeError: if input is not a str\n    - ValueError: if input is not a single character or not an ASCII character\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(char, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a str of length 1\")\n    if len(char) != 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input string must be a single character\")\n    code = ord(char)\n    if code > 127:\n        raise ValueError(\"Character is not in ASCII range (0..127)\")\n    return code"}
