{"task_id": "Mbpp/422", "solution": "def find_Average_Of_Cube(n: int) -> float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the average of the cubes of the first n natural numbers.\n    Uses the closed-form formula for the sum of cubes.\n\n    Example:\n        find_Average_Of_Cube(2) == 4.5\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int):\n        raise TypeError(f\"n must be an int, got {type(n).__name__}\")\n    if n < 1:\n        raise ValueError(\"n must be >= 1\")\n\n    # Sum of cubes formula: (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2\n    half_sum = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    sum_of_cubes = half_sum * half_sum\n\n    # Average is sum_of_cubes divided by n\n    return sum_of_cubes / n"}
